<p class="mb-8 reveal">I build outbound systems for a living, but that's not really who I am — it's just what I'm good at right now.</p>
<p class="mb-8 reveal">I box. Featherweight. There's something clean about it that I don't get anywhere else — no ambiguity, no politics, just you, the work you put in, and whether you did it or not. The gym is the same way for me. It's where the noise stops.</p>
<!-- Group 2 (Left) -->
<div class="mr-12 mb-10 ml-auto md:ml-0 float-none md:float-left w-full md:w-[480px] my-4 z-20 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 reveal"><div class="w-48 md:w-52 flex-shrink-0 -rotate-2 transition-transform duration-500 hover:rotate-0 hover:scale-[1.03] cursor-pointer relative">
